LABEL DDR2 main RAM first silicon check: old 64K alias boundary must be gone
SENDCR
PAUSE 2
LABEL deposit distinct values across the old wrap point and the 22-AUG pair
SEND 177777/111111
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 200000/122222
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 1000/104521
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 1004/104525
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
LABEL read all four back - each must hold its own value
SEND 177777/
EXPECT 10 111111
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 200000/
EXPECT 10 122222
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 1000/
EXPECT 10 104521
SENDCR
PAUSE 1
SEND 1004/
EXPECT 10 104525
SENDCR
QUIET 2
